jonellis@flagstaff.Princeton.EDU (Jonathan Ellis) writes:

>	Off the subject, what's the format of the record/logfile stuff?
>Example:
>940502 1 0 27 28 117 124 441358 VF Thoresa,drowned in a pool of water by an electric eel

First there is the date of game ending, in this case the 2nd of May.
Then there is uid (seems to always be 1 in the msdos version, don't know about
   the versions for other operating systems)
Next is the type of dungeon where the game ended.
 0=Dungeons of Doom, 1=Gehennom, 2=Gnomisgh mines, 3=Quest, 4=Fort Ludios,
 5=Vlad's Tower, 6=Endgame. There is also 6 if you ascended.
Next are..
>level on when died
>max level visited
>hitpoints when died
>max hp
>class, sex

Then there is your name, and after the comma the reason for game ending.

I have written a program to list the file in the same format as the game
itself shows it, with some improvements. Maybe I should post the source for
the newest version again one of these days..
